Hi {Owner},

I build websites for dog trainers around {City}. {Business Name} has real training results on its social pages, but no site where an owner can see your programmes, pick a class or book an evaluation.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a puppy and manners class schedule with enrolment, a behaviour intake form, a board-and-train page and a plain statement of your method, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and class date changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone between sessions?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
